  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AZN: Climate Policy Reform Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Climate Policy Reform Initiative aims to enhance legal frameworks and policies for better climate resilience in Azerbaijan. By providing accessible legal aid and education online, the project seeks to empower citizens about their environmental rights and advocate for the integration of international climate standards into national laws. The initiative includes launching social media campaigns, producing educational videos, developing key policy documents, and organizing public discussions. Additionally, capacity-building workshops and training sessions will be conducted for volunteers and legal faculty students. The project targets reaching 500,000 individuals and aims to create a lasting impact on environmental advocacy and policy reform in Azerbaijan.</narrative>
  </description>
